{"page":244,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.5 • 연결지향형 트랜스포트• TCP","words":[{"text":"3.5","x":976,"y":141,"width":42,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":1052,"y":146,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"연결지향형","x":1098,"y":140,"width":131,"height":30},{"text":"트랜스포트•","x":1241,"y":141,"width":142,"height":29},{"text":"TCP","x":1398,"y":143,"width":62,"height":25}]},{"text":"클라이언트 측의 애플리케이션은 새로운 TCP 연결을(2장의 파이썬 예제에서와 같이","words":[{"text":"클라이언트","x":185,"y":262,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"측의","x":371,"y":263,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":455,"y":264,"width":231,"height":37},{"text":"새로운","x":701,"y":265,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":812,"y":271,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"연결을(2장의","x":898,"y":267,"width":196,"height":37},{"text":"파이썬","x":1114,"y":266,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"예제에서와","x":1233,"y":266,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"같이","x":1418,"y":267,"width":63,"height":37}]},{"text":"자바 예제에서 소켓 객체를 생성함으로씨) 초기화한다. 이것은 클라이언트의 TCP가","words":[{"text":"자바","x":185,"y":323,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"예제에서","x":270,"y":324,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"소켓","x":424,"y":324,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"객체를","x":509,"y":325,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"생성함으로씨)","x":622,"y":325,"width":206,"height":39},{"text":"초기화한다.","x":846,"y":326,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"이것은","x":1041,"y":326,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트의","x":1159,"y":325,"width":201,"height":38},{"text":"TCP가","x":1379,"y":326,"width":107,"height":37}]},{"text":"서버의 TCP에게 SYN 세그먼트를 송신하도록 한다. SYN 세그먼트를 송신한 뒤, 클","words":[{"text":"서버의","x":186,"y":384,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"TCP에게","x":302,"y":385,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"SYN","x":458,"y":389,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":548,"y":385,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"송신하도록","x":727,"y":386,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":905,"y":386,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"SYN","x":997,"y":390,"width":76,"height":29},{"text":"세그먼트를",